<title>USA: Trega Biosciences names Ghodsian acting CFO.</title>
<headline>Trega Biosciences names Ghodsian acting CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trega Biosciences Inc said Friday Fariba Ghodsian assumed the duties of strategic and financial advisor and acting chief financial officer.</p>
<p>She replaces Terence McMorrow who has resigned to pursue other opportunities.  In her role, Ghodsian will be involved in investor relations, strategic planning and financial operations.</p>
<p>Ghodsian was most recently a vice president and biotechnology analyst at Lehman Brothers.</p>
